#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Base resource: the `{field}` field holds each record's subtype ({kinds}). It lists and reads "
"every kind; each subtype creates, updates and deletes its own."
msgstr ""
"Recurso base: el campo `{field}` indica el subtipo de cada registro ({kinds}). Lista y consulta "
"todos los tipos; se crean, modifican y eliminan en cada subtipo."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Subtype of [{base}]({base}.md) (`{identity}`): it shares its ids, common fields, state machines "
"and hooks."
msgstr ""
"Subtipo de [{base}]({base}.md) (`{identity}`): comparte sus identificadores, los campos comunes, "
"las máquinas de estados y los hooks."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Multi-tenant: each record belongs to the tenant in `{field}`; operations are limited to the "
"caller's tenant."
msgstr ""
"Multiinquilino: cada registro pertenece al inquilino del campo `{field}`; las operaciones se "
"limitan al inquilino de quien llama."

